# Releases (CalVer)

Playbook (dispatch Action, then PR): `.cursor/skills/calver-release/SKILL.md`.

- Production releases are merges into **`master`** (usually from `develop`).
- Cut the version with GitHub Action **CalVer release on develop** (`workflow_dispatch`). Do **not** hand-bump `package.json` for production unless the user asks.
- Format: `YYYY.MM.DD` in `America/New_York`; same day extras are `YYYY.MM.DD.1`, `.2`, …
- Do **not** push CalVer commits directly to **`master`** (PRs required).
- Feature work stays on `develop`; do not open routine feature PRs into `master`.
